---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for Bump Compass — what we collect, what we don't, and why.">
  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>

    <p>We collect almost nothing. The calculators on this site run entirely in your browser. We do not store your dates, your inputs, or any personal information.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>

    <h3>Information you provide</h3>
    <p>We do not have a contact form. If you contact us by email, we receive your email address and the contents of your message. We use this only to respond to you.</p>

    <h3>Information we collect automatically</h3>
    <p>We do not use analytics. We do not track visitors. We do not build profiles.</p>

    <h2>What we do NOT collect</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>We do not store your calculator inputs (dates, cycle lengths, etc.)</li>
      <li>We do not use analytics or tracking scripts</li>
      <li>We do not sell, rent, or share any information with third parties for their marketing purposes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>

    <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. AdSense may use cookies and similar technologies to serve personalized ads and to measure ad performance. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

    <p>We do not set any cookies ourselves. The site functions entirely without first-party cookies.</p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>

    <p>Our guides may contain links to third-party websites, including affiliate links. When you click an affiliate link, the destination site may collect information about you, including through cookies. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party sites. We encourage you to read their privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>

    <p>We do not retain any personal information. Calculator inputs are processed in your browser and never transmitted to our servers. If you contact us by email, we retain your message only as long as necessary to respond.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>

    <p>If you are in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal information we hold about you. You also have the right to object to or restrict our processing of your data. To exercise these rights, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
